.* DSPJRNRCVA: a journal receiver's attributes. No golden: the pub400
.* account owns no journal (title and keys).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=RCV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JRN CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JRNLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RCVTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ATTACHED CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DETACHED CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=FIRSTSEQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LASTSEQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ENTRIES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SIZE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRVRCV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=NXTRCV CLASS=NAMECL.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/RAKEYS' NAME=RAKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJRNRCVA KEYL=RAKEYS HELP=DSPJRNRCVA ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Journal Receiver Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RCV' VAR=RCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Receiver
:DATACOL WIDTH=38.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RCVLIB' VAR=RCVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JRN' VAR=JRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JRNLIB' VAR=JRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RCVTEXT' VAR=RCVTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STATUS' VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ATTACHED' VAR=ATTACHED USAGE=OUTPUT.Attached date and time
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DETACHED' VAR=DETACHED USAGE=OUTPUT.Detached date and time
:DATAI HELP='FLD/FIRSTSEQ' VAR=FIRSTSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.First sequence number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LASTSEQ' VAR=LASTSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Last sequence number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/ENTRIES' VAR=ENTRIES USAGE=OUTPUT.Number of entries
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SIZE' VAR=SIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Size (bytes)
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRVRCV' VAR=PRVRCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Previous receiver
:DATAI HELP='FLD/NXTRCV' VAR=NXTRCV USAGE=OUTPUT.Next receiver
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPJRNRCVA.Display Journal Receiver Attributes - Help
:P.A journal receiver: the journal it belongs to, when it was attached
and detached, the sequence numbers of the entries it holds, and its
neighbours in the receiver chain.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/RAKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RCV'.Receiver
:P.The receiver shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RCVLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JRN'.Journal
:P.The journal, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JRNLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RCVTEXT'.Text
:P.The text shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STATUS'.Status
:P.The status shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ATTACHED'.Attached date and time
:P.The attached date and time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DETACHED'.Detached date and time
:P.The detached date and time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FIRSTSEQ'.First sequence number
:P.The first sequence number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LASTSEQ'.Last sequence number
:P.The last sequence number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ENTRIES'.Number of entries
:P.The number of entries shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SIZE'.Size (bytes)
:P.The size (bytes) shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRVRCV'.Previous receiver
:P.The previous receiver shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NXTRCV'.Next receiver
:P.The next receiver shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
